<title>USA: Stanley Furniture to offer 2.4 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Stanley Furniture to offer 2.4 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>STANLEYTOWN, Va. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stanley Furniture Co Inc said Tuesday it had filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission for an offering of 2.4 million shares.</p>
<p>The shares comprise all of its common stock held by ML-Lee Acquisition Fund LP and certain affiliates of Thomas H. Lee Co, it said.</p>
<p>It said underwriters have an option to purchase up to an additional 358,902 shares to cover over-allotments.</p>
<p>Stanley Furniture said it will purchase any shares subject to the over-allotment option that are not purchased by the underwriters.</p>
</text>
